TrackMe 1.8.0

• Warning text is readable again. The amber used for warnings failed the accessibility contrast minimum on light backgrounds — it now clears it comfortably in both light and dark.

• Cleaner surfaces. Cards, sheets and the navigation bar now sit at genuinely different levels instead of blending into the background.

• Dividers and borders no longer look identical, so lists and grouped settings are easier to scan.

• Groundwork for a wider visual refresh arriving over the next few releases.

Nothing about tracking, group rides, sync or export changes in this update.
